  "limitations": [
    "The pinned source is Aave V3.7 current source, not evidence that the same code was deployed at any historical event; every historical candidate requires block-matched proxy and implementation verification.",
    "Source conformance does not establish that an eligible strict liquidation-threshold decrease exists, that account state can be reconstructed completely, or that a causal response panel is identified.",
    "An eMode collateral override makes the direct effect of the base-reserve liquidation-threshold change exactly zero for that account-reserve route.",
    "A health-factor crossing is not sufficient for executable liquidation: reserve activity, pause and grace-period state, debt and collateral eligibility and the transaction path also matter.",
    "Frozen-reserve changes and same-transaction changes to eMode, oracle, indexes or other account-relevant configuration are outside the strict effect class.",
    "LTV changes affect borrowing capacity rather than this health-factor identity, while liquidation-bonus changes affect liquidation payoffs; both are excluded to avoid a bundled response estimand.",
    "The source licence audit records the pinned Business Source License 1.1 text and is not legal advice.",
    "This stage opens no chain event, governance payload, account, action, liquidation or response rows and authorizes no GPU work or G1 admission."
  ],
